# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Icon assets — GENERATED, NEVER COMMITTED
#
# Iconsax's Free License allows embedding the icons in your app, but forbids
# redistributing the artwork itself (loose or in packs), including modified
# versions. So the SVG files must not live in this public repo.
#
# Run `node skills/harmonyos-ui-icons/scripts/bootstrap.mjs` after cloning to
# fetch them from the official Iconsax CDN.
# See skills/harmonyos-ui-icons/assets/README.md and NOTICE.md.
#
# Pattern is depth-agnostic on purpose: the icons must stay ignored even if the
# bundle layout moves again.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/assets/iconsax/
**/assets/iconsax-anim/

